#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""acczLOL — one-file Telegram bot, Mini App, admin UI and MTProto worker.

INSTALL (Python 3.11+):
    python -m pip install 'aiohttp>=3.10,<4' 'cryptography>=43' 'Telethon>=1.45,<2' 'qrcode[pil]>=8,<9'
CONFIGURE:
    python bot.py --setup
RUN:
    python bot.py
DEMO (no Telegram credentials, no real payments):
    python bot.py --demo --port 8080
TESTS:
    python bot.py --self-test

Required: BOT_TOKEN, PUBLIC_URL (your HTTPS origin), TELEGRAM_API_ID,
TELEGRAM_API_HASH from my.telegram.org. A real authorized StringSession or
Telethon .session is uploaded by the administrator; no account login is faked.
Site pictures, fonts, HTML, CSS and JS are embedded below. Premium Telegram
emoji are resolved through Bot API after the bot is connected.
The program creates acczlol_data/store.sqlite3 and a private encryption key.
Use a persistent disk for DATA_DIR. Keep its encryption key when migrating.
ADMIN_KEY can override the supplied administrator key. Its default is stored
only as a salted PBKDF2 digest, never in HTML, JS or the database as plaintext.
ADMIN_IDS may limit administrator access to comma-separated Telegram IDs.

Optional processes, using the SAME DATA_DIR/key: --role web, --role bot,
--role agent. Default --role all runs the components as isolated async tasks.
SQLite WAL is suitable for a single-host shop; it is not a distributed DB.

Mini App authentication: validated Telegram initData -> opaque server session.
Standalone browser authentication: /login command in the bot -> one-use app code.
Deposits: Decimal RUB/LTC quote, the specified Litecoin address, manual admin
approval, unique transaction hash, atomic ledger credit. Clicking 'paid' never
credits money by itself. No smart contract or automatic blockchain settlement
is implied. Quote uses CoinGecko, with Kraken LTC/USD × CBR USD/RUB fallback.
Litecoin has eight decimal places; the required amount rounds UP to one litoshi.

Purchases: atomic balance debit + stock reservation; the worker validates the
authorized account session, completes delivery or refunds the hold atomically.
Only a paid order's buyer can request a fresh Telegram login code. The worker
reads service dialog 777000, not other chats. It does NOT initiate a new login
on behalf of a stranger. Buyer requests login in Telegram, then presses Get code.
2FA passwords are provided with stock and encrypted; unknown existing cloud
passwords cannot be recovered from Telegram. .tdata is not a .session file.

Premium emoji/button IDs are the supplied IDs. Telegram may require Premium
on the bot owner or Fragment eligibility. Unsupported icons fall back to emoji.
Fullscreen uses expand() and requestFullscreen() on supported Telegram 8.0+
clients, safe-area events and a manual retry button when the client refuses.

No bot token, MTProto key, payment approval or real account is supplied by this
file. The runnable integration requires your actual credentials and sessions.
"""
